    "displayName": "RESOURCE DRIVE: LARGE GOODS RECOVERY",
    "titleSource": "localized_clean",
    "titleConfidence": "high",
    "briefing": "One of our transports was recently attacked by outlaws and while we’re relieved that the crew was spared, the cargo was stolen.\n\nIt’s of the utmost importance that we get the [ItemsToRecover] cargo boxes (all [MaxBoxSize] SCU or smaller) back, as it contains a large amount of vital materials needed for the UEE’s resource contest.\n\nLuckily, the outlaws that took our goods haven’t noticed that our trackers are still intact. Our cargo is being held at [Location].\n\nThese outlaws are highly dangerous, so please arm yourself accordingly and consider bringing allies. Ideally, you’ll be able to recover all the cargo, but considering how dangerous the situation is, we will offer partial payment for whatever you’re able to retrieve.\n\nWhen you’ve recovered the cargo, safely transport it to a freight elevator at: [Destination]. Once it’s delivered, our team will handle it from there.\n\nTake care of yourself out there.\n\nDenver Samuels\nContractor Liaison Officer\nCrusader Industries",
